  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "K\u0131ymetli {{isim}}, ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"De\u011Fnek Krali\xE7esi\"
    kart\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7tin.\n\nBu kart, ge\xE7mi\u015Fte hep zirveyi d\xFC\u015Flemi\u015F
    olanlar\u0131n eline ge\xE7er. \xD6zel hayat\u0131nda da maddi anlamda da kendin
    i\xE7in en iyiyi ve en hay\u0131rl\u0131y\u0131 arzulam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    Diledi\u011Fin her ne varsa yazg\u0131nda sana ihsan edilmi\u015F. Onlara kavu\u015Fman\u0131
    sa\u011Flayacak basamaklarda \xE7\u0131karken, bir han\u0131mefendiden de yard\u0131m
    alman kararla\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015F. Bu yard\u0131m hen\xFCz sana
    ula\u015Fmam\u0131\u015F olabilir ancak zaman\u0131 belirlenmi\u015F. G\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCm
    kadar\u0131yla bo\u015Flukta as\u0131l\u0131 kald\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCn
    her evrede, sana k\xFClli irade taraf\u0131ndan kendini yukar\u0131ya \xE7ekebilece\u011Fin
    bir ip uzat\u0131lmas\u0131 planlanm\u0131\u015F."
